260ffafc87403ce","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"chore: Add assertions to message classes","messageBody":"There are several instances where the messages accept task objects\nHowever, it may not be safe to assume that they are not null, even\nif the contract obligates it.\n\nAdding an assertion check would ensure in development that the\nmessages do not receive a null task. Let\u0027s add assertions to the\nMessage subclasses.\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":5,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"f095ec0c9875d37f114093bf5150de2ee25ecf57","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"chore: Improve magic literal readability","messageBody":"Command parsing, message formatting, UI configuration, and task display code contain literals whose purpose is not always clear at their use sites.\n\nThese values make maintenance harder because readers must infer whether a literal represents a format, delay, separator, or domain-specific value.\n\nLet\u0027s replace repeated and non-obvious literals with descriptive constants while keeping simple, one-off literals at their point of use.\n\nThis preserves application behaviour and keeps constants limited to values that improve readability.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":76,"deletions":30}}},{"hash":"ac0124afcc9140cb4f9758780ef97c8a4bff86cb","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"refactor: Simplify command and UI workflows","messageBody":"Command processing and user-input handling mix high-level application workflows with parsing, dialog construction, and delayed exit details.\n\nThis makes the primary control flow harder to read and leaves the final-message exit thread unstarted.\n\nLet\u0027s extract command execution, final-message exit handling, and conversation display into focused helper methods.\n\nStart the delayed exit thread in the final-message helper so farewell responses complete the intended shutdown.\n\nThe Java 25 Gradle test suite and Checkstyle pass. The console UI runner cannot compile this JavaFX application because it omits JavaFX dependencies.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":53,"deletions":20},"md":{"insertions":9,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"142739d0d6e090c0009f42e0a7428554838defd5","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from AaravMalani/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"chore: Improve code quality of `ArthurDent`","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"41f2b0f13a9160b0ea1736e21668022e38c27896","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 of https://github.com/AaravMalani/ip into branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"bf7f384ec7a4272e2feae336f99b39c5cc732ac8","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from AaravMalani/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"chore: Add assertions to message classes","tags":["A-Streams","A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"b5f87afcbbe6035818c4965eb70b312a1cda4ace","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"chore: Add JavaDoc comments","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":10,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"511d535b0fb2260c50c9348645e47719a7882e2e","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from AaravMalani/branch-A-CI","messageBody":"chore: Add CI to the repository","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-09-06T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"a11dc1fc38c94971a6afdb46a47486cbff6f5247","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"feat: Add prefixes of commands to work","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":15,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"0f9095245e1c061cf3321b49b65b17c79cca2009","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"feat: Add command aliases","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":292,"deletions":6},"md":{"insertions":10,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"15459265b5174179f31549be8364e13df81d69b3","isMergeCommit":true,"m